              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Rus 2:4",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Kosodi kanen, napedauni ŋesi ainakin ainakinet naicweio, koany, kobu Samuel; kolot Saul airiamun kaŋes, tetere iyogai ŋes. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.13.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.13.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 13:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kotema Samuel atiar, “Inyo bo iswamaa ijo?” Kotema Saul atiar, “Naarai abu kaany iruna isiararos kamakaŋ, mam da jo ibu kobu kapaarasia kanuaseunitai, atukokina da Ipilisitian Mikimas; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.13.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.13.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 13:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ŋes atemaria eoŋ ebe, ‘Epote do Ipilisitian mama ajai Giligal, mam elipit asianut naka EJAKAIT’: ŋes etinaikinor ainakin ainakinet naicweio.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.13.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.13.12"
            ]
          }
        },
