              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Kobala Samuel Saul ebe, “Iswama nukabanaanut; mam irieit aicorakinet naka EJAKAIT Ekonideke naabu kicorak jo, naarai ti EJAKAIT kiticat akonijakanut koIsirael ikar kere. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.13.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
